<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="container-fluid m-0"
    style="background-image: url('https://picsum.photos/id/317/1200'); background-position:top; background-color: bisque; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-attachment: fixed; background-size: cover;">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>
        <%= title %>
    </title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styler.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
</head>

<body class="container flex bg-dark-subtle border border-dark backdrop-blur rounded-3">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <h1 class="text-center text-white p-3 mt-4 mb-4 rounded-3">
            <span aria-label="smiley" role="img">🤖 </span>
            APIExpressHub
            <span aria-label="robot" role="img">&#128646;</span>
        </h1>
    </div>
    <div id="welc" class="container-fluid text-center p-5 row bg-primary-subtle">
        <h2> Hello, World! Welcome to APIExpressHub
        </h2>
        <h4>-- This is a basic <a href="https://ejs.co/" class="text-decoration-none">EJS</a> templating
            Web App</h4>
    </div>
    <div>
        <section id="tips">
            <h3 class="callout-info">Tips to get you started!</h3>
            <ul class="callout-info">
                <li>Use the navigation links below to explore different API functionalities!</li>
                <li>For developer related material, check out the source code -- or hyper-extended commit history - on
                    <a href="https://github.com/LIGunna93/APIExpressHUB" class="text-decoration-none">GitHub</a>
                </li>
                <li>You only have to click to call a route to generate some pictures!</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
    <hr class="container-fluid border-dark">
    <div id="navigationLinks"
        class="container-fluid text-dark p-3 gap-3 flex-row justify-content-center d-flex mt-4 mb-4 rounded-3">
        <h6 class="p-3 bg-primary-subtle text-center">Navigate to <a href="/jokes"
                class="text-decoration-none">JokeHub</a> to
            see some funny jokes!</h6>
        <h6 class="p-3 bg-primary-subtle text-center">Navigate to <a href="/pichub"
                class="text-decoration-none">PicHub</a> to generate some pictures!</h6>
    </div>
    <hr class="container-fluid border-dark">
    <h4 class="callout-info text-center p-3" style="background-color: transparent;">Have a great time exploring the
        APIs! 😊</h4>
    <hr>

    <footer class="container-lg flex p-3 mt-4 mb-0 rounded-3 bg-primary-subtle text-dark">

        <div class="container-fluid flex text-center p-3 justify-content-center d-flex gap-5">
            <div id="footercontact" class="container-sm d-flex border p-3 rounded-2 boxshadow-dark boxshadow-hover">
                <p>💬</p>
                <p style="font-size: larger; font-weight: 900;">Ping me for any queries or feedback!</p>
                <p>Phone: <a href="callto:+1234567890">+1234567890</a></p>
                <p>Email: <a href="mailto:devliops@outlook.com">devliops@outlook.com</a></p>
            </div>
            <div id="footerlinks" class="container-sm d-flex p-3 rounded-2">
                <p>🖲</p>
                <p style="font-size: larger; font-weight: 900;">Keep up with me at these endpoints!</p>
                <ul style="background-color: transparent;">
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lio-ilu-93/"><img
                            src="https://img.icons8.com/nolan/40/linkedin.png" alt="linkedin" /></a>
                    <a href="https://x.com/IluDev93"><img src="https://img.icons8.com/nolan/40/twitterx.png"
                            alt="x" /></a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/LIGunna93"><img src="/resources/images/Universal/Orion_github.png"
                            alt="github" /></a>
                </ul>
            </div>

        </div>
        <hr class="container-fluid border-dark">
        <section class="container-fluid">
            <p style="display: inline-flex;">&copy; 2025 APIExpressHub</p>
            <p style="display: inline-flex;"><a href="/views/policy.ejs">Privacy Policy</a></p>
            <h6 style="display: inline-flex;">A design by <em>DevLI</em> of LI Dev</h6>
        </section>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>